====== OSEM ======


===== Install =====

Installation via [docker] sur [celeste3]

<code>
sudo mkdir /var/www/pgday.fr                                                                                                                               
sudo -u www-data git clone https://github.com/openSUSE/osem.git /var/www/pgday.fr                                                                          
sudo chown -R www-data: /var/www/pgday.fr                                                                                                         
sudo -u www-data git clone https://github.com/openSUSE/osem.git /var/www/pgday.fr                                                                 
cd /var/www/pgday.fr/
</code>

https://github.com/openSUSE/osem/blob/master/INSTALL.md#deploy-via-dockerdocker-compose


<code>
sudo cp dotenv.example .env.production
# modifier le paramètre SECRET_KEY
sudo vim .env.production
</code>

<code>
sudo docker compose -f docker-compose.yml.production-example build
sudo docker compose -f docker-compose.yml.production-example run --rm production_web bundle exec rake db:bootstrap
        
</code>               